    <textarea
      aria-hidden="true"
      style="letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;padding-top:2px;padding-bottom:2px;font-family:-webkit-small-control;font-weight:;font-size:;font-variant:;text-rendering:auto;text-transform:none;width:;text-indent:0;padding-left:2px;padding-right:2px;border-width:1px;box-sizing:;word-break:;
  min-height:0 !important;
  max-height:none !important;
  height:0 !important;
  visibility:hidden !important;
  overflow:hidden !important;
  position:absolute !important;
  z-index:-1000 !important;
  top:0 !important;
  right:0 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
"
      tab-index="-1"
    />
  </body>,
  "container": <div>
    <div>
      <h2>
        Get Started
      </h2>
      <div
        class="ant-row"
      >
        <div
          class="ant-col ant-col-16 ant-col-offset-4"
        >
          <h4
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Verbal notice of a reportable incident, within 4 hours
          </h4>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Reportable incidents that cause 
            <b>
              serious injury
            </b>
             or 
            <b>
              loss of life
            </b>
             must be
             
            <b>
              reported verbally to the Ministry within 4 hours
            </b>
             of the incident occurrence. (HSRC 1.7.2)
          </div>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Call the 
            <b>
              Mine Incident Reporting Line at 
            </b>
            <a
              href="tel:1-888-348-0299"
            >
              <b>
                1-888-348-0299
              </b>
            </a>
            . This line is monitored 24/7 by an On-call Inspector.
          </div>
          <h4
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Written notice of a reportable incident, within 16 hours
          </h4>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            All reportable incidents must be
            <b>
               reported in writing to the Ministry within 16 hours
            </b>
             of the incident occurrence. This includes a reportable incident that caused, or had the potential to cause, serious injury or loss of life, or is classified as a dangerous occurrence. (HSRC 1.7.2)
          </div>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            <strong>
              Submitting a written notice of a reportable incident within MineSpace meets your mine’s written reporting responsibilities under the Ministry’s Incident Management Process Policy.
            </strong>
          </div>
          <div
            class="ant-alert ant-alert-warning ant-alert-with-description"
            data-show="true"
            role="alert"
          >
            <span
              aria-label="exclamation-circle"
              class="anticon anticon-exclamation-circle ant-alert-icon"
              role="img"
            >
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                data-icon="exclamation-circle"
                fill="currentColor"
                focusable="false"
                height="1em"
                viewBox="64 64 896 896"
                width="1em"
              >
                <path
                  d="M512 64C264.6 64 64 264.6 64 512s200.6 448 448 448 448-200.6 448-448S759.4 64 512 64zm0 820c-205.4 0-372-166.6-372-372s166.6-372 372-372 372 166.6 372 372-166.6 372-372 372z"
                />
                <path
                  d="M464 688a48 48 0 1096 0 48 48 0 10-96 0zm24-112h48c4.4 0 8-3.6 8-8V296c0-4.4-3.6-8-8-8h-48c-4.4 0-8 3.6-8 8v272c0 4.4 3.6 8 8 8z"
                />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div
              class="ant-alert-content"
            >
              <div
                class="ant-alert-description"
              >
                <div
                  class="ant-typography"
                >
                  A written notice of a reportable incident received within 4-hours satisfies both the requirement for the verbal report and the written report.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <br />
          <h5
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Do not disturb the scene of any reportable incident
          </h5>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            The scene of a reportable incident must not be disturbed (e.g., to return to regular operations), except for the purpose of 
            <b>
              saving life
            </b>
             or
             
            <b>
              relieving human suffering
            </b>
            . This is to preserve evidence for both the mine’s and the Ministry’s investigations. (HSRC, section 1.7.3)
          </div>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Only your OHSC worker representative or an inspector can release the scene.
          </div>
          <h5
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            After you complete your submission in MineSpace
          </h5>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            Mines must investigate the reportable incident and prepare an 
            <b>
              investigation report
            </b>
             
            to be submitted to an Inspector of Mines (HSRC, sections 1.7.1(4) & 1.7.2).
          </div>
          <div
            class="ant-typography"
          >
            After submitting your written notice of a reportable incident through MineSpace you are required to come back to your submission and add your investigation report.
          </div>
          <br />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>
          <button
            class="ant-btn ant-btn-secondary"
            id="step-1-cancel"
            style="margin-right: 15px;"
            type="button"
          >
            <span>
              Cancel
            </span>
          </button>
          <button
            class="ant-btn ant-btn-primary"
            id="step-1-next"
            type="button"
          >
            <span>
              Create Record
            </span>
          </button>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>
        Create Record
      </h2>
      <form
        class="ant-form ant-form-vertical common-form common-form-ADD_EDIT_INCIDENT form-edit"
        id="ADD_EDIT_INCIDENT"
      >
        <div
          class="ant-row"
        >
          <div
            class="ant-col ant-col-16 ant-col-offset-4"
          >
            <div
              class="bcgov-callout--warning nod-callout-text"
            >
              <div>
                <h4
                  id="initial-report"
                  style="color: rgb(49, 49, 50); font-weight: 700;"
                >
                  This Incident Has Been Closed
                </h4>
                <p>
                  This incident has been reviewed and has been closed.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <br />
            <div
              class="ant-row"
              style="margin-left: -8px; margin-right: -8px;"
            >
              <div
                class="ant-col ant-col-24"
                style="padding-left: 8px; padding-right: 8px;"
              >
                <h4
                  class="ant-typography"
                >
                  Reporter Details
                </h4>
                <div
                  class="ant-typography"
                >
                  Enter all available details about the reporter of this incident.
                </div>
              </div>
              <div
                class="ant-col ant-col-xs-24 ant-col-md-10"
                style="padding-left: 8px; padding-right: 8px;"
              >
                <div
                  class="ant-form-item ant-form-item-with-help"
                >
                  <div
                    class="ant-row ant-form-item-row"
                  >
                    <div
                      class="ant-col ant-form-item-label"
                    >
                      <label
                        class="ant-form-item-required"
                        for="ADD_EDIT_INCIDENT_reported_by_name"
                        title=""
                      >
                        <div
                          style="width: 100%;"
                        >
